Source landscape: the 2023 Indonesia/Jokowi 7B universe is dominated by dynasty/nepotism and electoral-ethics materials around Gibran’s vice-presidential path, plus formal court/commission records, anticorruption and audit context, and a smaller set of academic and editorial sources on trust, oligarchy, and accountability. I found a mix of favorable, adverse, and exculpatory leads; the highest-value primary candidates are the MK/MKMK, KPU, DKPP, and BPK records, with Reuters/ANTARA/local-news and academic chapters providing triangulation.

